  "estimatedSeconds": 720,
  "stem": "The polynomial $p(x) = 6x^{3} + ax^{2} + bx - 2$, where $a$ and $b$ are constants, has a factor $2x - 1$. When $p(x)$ is divided by $x + 1$ the remainder is $6$.",
