         {
          "id": "p2",
          "description": "A1 multiplies by 4 and rearranges to $a + 2b = 5$",
          "marks": 1
         }
        ]
       },
       "modelAnswer": "$$\np\\left(\\tfrac{1}{2}\\right) = \\tfrac{3}{4} + \\tfrac{a}{4} + \\tfrac{b}{2} - 2 = 0\n$$\n\n$$\n3 + a + 2b - 8 = 0 \\;\\Rightarrow\\; a + 2b = 5\n$$"
